sts (name and quantity) from:\\n     2\\t   - Li Ming (Database)\\n     3\\t   - Zhang Wei (Database)\\n     4\\t   - Huang Jie (Product)\\n     5\\t   - Sophia Rodriguez (Product)\\n     6\\t   at http://the-agent-company.com:3000/home\\n     7\\t\\n     8\\t2. Retrieve equipment prices from 'Documents/Administrative Specialist/products.pdf' on owncloud(http://the-agent-company.com:8092)\\n     9\\t\\n    10\\t3. Tell them the total cost of the equipment they requested.\\n    11\\t\\n    12\\t4. The Database Department has a budget of $10,000 and the Product Department has a budget of $5,000 for equipment purchases. Calculate whether each department's budget is sufficient. If the budget is NOT sufficient, contact everyone in the department and ask them to reduce their expense.\\n    13\\t\\n    14\\t5. Record equipment changes (if any) in '/workspace/result.txt' using format 'Name removed Equipment' (e.g., 'Chen Xinyi removed Printer'). No recording needed if no changes.\\n```\\n\\nPlan (8 steps):\\n1. Visit http://the-agent-company.com:3000/home and collect equipment requests from Li Ming, Zhang Wei, Huang Jie, and Sophia Rodriguez [rocketchat]\\n2. Retrieve 'Documents/Administrative Specialist/products.pdf' from ownCloud to access equipment prices need download [owncloud]\\n3. Calculate the total cost of equipment for each person using the collected requests and price list\\n4. Calculate the total equipment cost for the Database Department (Li Ming and Zhang Wei) and the Product Department (Huang Jie and Sophia Rodriguez)\\n5. Compare the Database Department total cost against its $10,000 budget and the Product Department total cost against its $5,000 budget\\n6. Contact all Database Department members (Li Ming and Zhang Wei) and request expense reductions if their department budget is insufficient need reply [rocketchat]\\n7. Contact all Product Department members (Huang Jie and Sophia Rodriguez) and request expense reductions if their department budget is insufficient need reply [rocketchat]\\n8. Record any equipment changes resulting from budget adjustments in '/workspace/result.txt' using the specified format\\n\\n Starting step 1: Visit http://the-agent-company.com:3000/home and collect equipment requests from Li Ming, Zhang Wei, Huang Jie, and Sophia Rodriguez [rocketchat]\", image_urls=None, wait_for_response=False, action=<ActionType.MESSAGE: 'message'>, security_risk=None), MessageAction(content=\"You are currently executing a planned step. Follow these instructions EXACTLY:\\n\\nTASK: Visit http://the-agent-company.com:3000/home and collect equipment requests from Li Ming, Zhang Wei, Huang Jie, and Sophia Rodriguez [rocketchat] \\n\\nCurrent Progress: 1 step / 8 steps\\n\\nGuidelines: Rocketchat Usage RULE:\\n- The Username is the 'theagentcompany' and the password is 'theagentcompany'\\n- when searching the people name to talk, please USE full name including first name and last name to make sure find the correct person. \\n- When need reply from people, please first send the message follow the 3 instructions below: \\n    First, explicitly acknowledge the person's role in your message. (e.g. Hi, [name], I understand you're team leader/manager)\\n    Second, expalin reason about the task or step\\n    Third, clearly provide the requirement for the people\\n- Please send the message to people if the task required\\n- If you send the message including the numbers (e.g. money, budget, count etc.), please send the plain numbers without formating (e.g. comma) \\n- If you just the conclusion to the person, please make message concrete and clear without extra words.\\n \\n\\nRULES:\\n- Do NOT deviate from this step.\\n- Use available tools to make PROGRESS.\\n- When you have FULLY and SUCCESSFULLY completed this step, output ONLY the following line and nothing else:\\n  <|STEP_COMPLETED|>\\n\\n\", image_urls=None, wait_for_response=False, action=<ActionType.MESSAGE: 'message'>, security_risk=None), BrowseInteractiveActio